RC ..> ApiSvc : implements
AuthRepo --> SM
AuthRepo --> ApiSvc
RideRepo --> ApiSvc
DriverRepo --> ApiSvc
AIRepo --> ApiSvc
SockMgr ..> DLoc
SockMgr ..> RStat
ApiSvc ..> RegReq
ApiSvc ..> LogReq
ApiSvc ..> AuthRes
ApiSvc ..> UserDto
ApiSvc ..> DriverDto
ApiSvc ..> RideDto
ApiSvc ..> EarnDto
ApiSvc ..> ChatDto
ApiSvc ..> AISchDto
ApiSvc ..> BatchDto

